=== Coleman-Chabauty on genus-3 Saunderson C' (rank J = 2 < 3) ===
Known rational points on C' (Saunderson doc): (t,T) in {(0,+-1),(+-1,+-4)} -> all degenerate.

p (good, p>6) | #C'(F_p) | Coleman bound #C(F_p)+2g-2 = +4
p=7 | #C'(F_p)=8 | Coleman bound <= 12
p=11 | #C'(F_p)=24 | Coleman bound <= 28
p=13 | #C'(F_p)=28 | Coleman bound <= 32
p=17 | #C'(F_p)=12 | Coleman bound <= 16
p=19 | #C'(F_p)=8 | Coleman bound <= 12
p=23 | #C'(F_p)=40 | Coleman bound <= 44

Min over p gives the sharpest finite Coleman bound on |C'(Q)|.
This bound is SIGMA-FREE (depends only on rank J(C')=2<3, not on Szpiro).
